WEBVTT

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.880
I remember everything,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.760
but he can't remember a thing.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.390
Yujin.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.680
It's almost as if those things didn't happen,

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.810
or as if my memories are false.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.940
He's still suffering and in pain,

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.200
so are Sanghyuk, Chelin, and Mom.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.740
There's nothing I can do for them.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.740
What a hassle.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:40.660
Hey, Jinsook?

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:50.550
Look at this.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:53.460
Didn't I tell you to tie up the chains correctly?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.490
That's what I told them.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:59.340
Is there something wrong with it?

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.840
We're not working with these guys anymore.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:06.310
We can't afford even minor mistakes.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:07.890
We're only days away from the show.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:09.730
Everyone get your act together, okay?

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.690
Could you tell me the status of Minhyung Lee, the patient in room 701?

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.080
Yes.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.150
Yes.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:23.950
I see.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.660
We're going to go visit the Director at the hospital.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:30.710
Wanna come with?

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.880
Sorry, I still have work to do.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.460
Take it easy, okay?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.960
We can't have you getting sick again.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.270
<i>Hello?</i>

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:04.740
<i>Hey, Yujin!</i>

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.870
<i>It's me, Jinsook.</i>

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.240
Hello? Jinsook?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.290
<i>Where are you right now?</i>

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.370
What's all the noise in the background?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.750
<i>I'm drinking with Sanghyuk and Yongguk...</i>

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.250
I can't hear you; talk louder.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.710
You better quit whatever you're working on right now.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:24.090
How can you be like this to Sanghyuk?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.000
I've stopped myself from saying this to you many times before,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.260
but I've had it now.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.560
You got that?

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.340
Do you get what I'm saying...

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.340
So much for drunk dialing.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.270
Get off the phone, will you?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.270
Hey...

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.080
Don't try to stop me.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.560
I'm not even a little bit drunk.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.940
Who exactly is that guy, Yujin?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:44.240
Do you even understand how ridiculous it is

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.530
that you're still working with him?

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.720
I wasn't going to say this,

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.350
but you and I both know that you think about Joonsang

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.290
every time you see his face.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.670
Why are you interfering when even Sanghyuk said it's fine?

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.800
And you call yourself his friend, Yongguk?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.260
<i>How do you think Sanghyuk feels every time he looks at Yujin</i>

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.430
<i>who thinks about Joonsang every time she looks at that guy's face?</i>

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.890
Hey, Yujin, Jinsook is drunk out of her mind right now.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.020
I'll tell Sanghyuk to call you back later.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.930
You're part of the problem.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.320
Just tell her to stop working and come back to Seoul.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.230
Why?

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.900
You really don't feel a thing?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.780
He's in bed injured because of Yujin,

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.700
and they can see each other any time they want because of work.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.330
I really don't understand you guys.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.840
Especially you, Sanghyuk; I really don't get you.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.340
God, this girl.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.010
I'll take Jinsook home.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.140
Yeah, take care.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.880
You can't put these out in the snow.{orig- on the floor. - tly note: but they wouldn't get wet on the floor, and they're lying in the snow now...}

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:29.380
Why not? We're using them tomorrow, aren't we?

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.430
Don't you know that wood softens when wet

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:36.560
and that can, in turn, cause problems during construction?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.310
Plus it's under 0°C out here right now;

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.640
if these boards were to freeze—

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.900
You punk.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.420
Don't you realize that she can stop all the construction work

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.820
from progressing if she wants to?

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.530
Listen to what she says.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:50.240
Yes, sir.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:53.950
Better?

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.410
Are you going to keep following us around today too?

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.080
Yes.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.920
My boys apparently can't even take a piss right because of you.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:07.510
Could you cut them some slack, just for today?

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:12.220
Why don't we warm ourselves up with some coffee?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:14.890
Thank you!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.390
Let's all grab some morning coffee, shall we?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.400
Let me talk to you for a second, Yujin.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.220
I like how motivated you are with this,

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.530
but don't get too carried away, okay?

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.570
Carried away?

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.530
You have no idea how many complaints I've been getting about you.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:37.330
Even that guy over there keeps saying he wants a piece of you.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:45.380
Are you sure it's okay for you to put an injured person to work?

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:48.420
Sanghyuk.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.370
You're supposed to get your cast off today, aren't you?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.220
Why don't you go to the hospital with Sanghyuk?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.180
Try to squeeze in a date on your way back, while you're at it.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.300
Oh, come on.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.930
Satisfied?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:58.700
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:12.950
Tell me right away if you feel any pain or discomfort.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:13.490
Yes, Doctor.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:16.740
Now pull your arm slowly towards you.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.830
And stretch it back out.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.080
I heard your test results came out okay?

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.670
So you decided to bring me some homework, huh?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:30.670
Of course.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.880
Vacations are usually very short you know.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.840
I figured you've had enough rest.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.140
You better get started on the homework that's been piling up.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.600
You really are too much, Hyeoksoo.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.020
I only brought over the urgent stuff for now.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.210
I figured you'd start nagging me

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.330
to take you to the construction site like last time

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.980
unless I brought these.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.740
How are things at the construction site?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.030
Other than the workers going crazy because of Polaris' Miss Yujin,

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:59.070
it's going fine.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.870
What did Miss Yujin do?

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.160
There you go again.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.000
I meant to ask this sooner,

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.540
but why are you so interested in Polaris?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.710
Or is it Miss Yujin you're interested in?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.710
What are you talking about?

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.050
Even when we were going over the production plan back in America,

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.760
you requested that we work with Polaris

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.090
after talking to Yujin only once over the phone,

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:21.890
yet you seemed rather indecisive when we were talking to other companies.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:26.230
Don't you remember?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.100
Polaris...

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.690
And when I asked you why you chose Polaris, you said something like,

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:35.070
"I like the name," or "they won't get lost," or something.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.240
Don't you remember?

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:39.620
Polaris always remains in its place;

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:42.240
it never moves from its spot, regardless of the season.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.540
Have you ever felt like this, Mr. Kim?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:48.750
Why do you look so serious all of a sudden?

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:53.460
That is, have you ever felt like you're not yourself.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.200
What are you talking about?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.670
Simplify it a little.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.780
All these memories are suddenly springing up in my head,

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.260
but I don't recognize them.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.930
It's like someone knows me very well,

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.060
but I don't remember that person at all.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.720
Looks like your arm's doing better.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.200
Your face looks brighter too.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.330
How's Mr. Minhyung?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.540
He's better, thanks for your concern.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.170
Could you return this coat to him?

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:31.750
Sure.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:38.130
Why don't you give it back to him yourself?

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:47.140
I'm very thankful, Miss Yujin.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.400
Could I ask you what made you change your mind?

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.230
Mr. Minhyung is still a patient.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.320
He needs stability right now.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:01.240
Chelin told me that you're supposed to get married soon.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.660
Please excuse me.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.530
Remember, Miss Yujin,

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:09.500
you have no right to confuse or hurt Minhyung.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.890
It is my medical opinion

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:26.350
that these tests prove that there are no abnormalities with your brain.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.690
I don't know if this will help,

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:36.190
but in the medical history I received from your mother,

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.400
none of the records indicated the existence of a "Minhyung Lee"

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.900
at the time of the accident that you were involved in ten years ago.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.590
An accident?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.530
I was in an accident?

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:42.990
This is your coat, right?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.050
She said she's sorry that she didn't get to return it sooner.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.480
Who's Joonsang Kang?

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.400
Who exactly am I?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.600
Am I Minhyung Lee?

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.030
Or Joonsang Kang?

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.880
You want to listen to some music?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:29.470
It's hard, isn't it?

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.510
I'm sure it's very hard for you.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:32.890
What are you talking about?

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.350
Jeong-a was the one who called me.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.150
I thought you called her?

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:44.500
She said there must be something going on

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.150
for you to become so obsessive about work like this.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.610
She asked if we got into an argument recently,

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.300
how often we call each other these days,

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.910
and when the last time we went out on a date was.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.080
You know Jeong-a's only overreacting—

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.040
Yujin,

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:58.920
could you forget Joonsang for me now?

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.130
Why are you saying this?

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.250
I can drive if you're tired.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.210
I mean, I'm not in a cast anymore.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.380
Nothing's going to change...

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.390
even if Mr. Minhyung is Joonsang.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:16.890
What are you implying?

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.730
It's been ten years.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:32.620
For ten years I've stuck by your side, ever since Joonsang passed away.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:33.950
Sanghyuk...

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.460
I'll wait even if it takes another ten years.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.880
Sorry, Sanghyuk.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.550
He...

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:55.560
Mr. Minhyung <i>is</i> Joonsang.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.730
Tell me, Mother.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.730
Why don't we discuss this some other time.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.570
All these strange memories inside here are confusing me.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.180
Who is Joonsang Kang?

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:12.990
Who am I?

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.940
Am I really Minhyung Lee?

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.910
Who exactly am I?

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.650
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.790
I'm really sorry, Minhyung.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.420
Am I really Joonsang Kang?

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.010
Then why...

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.760
Why did I have to live as Minhyung and not Joonsang?

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.140
There was no other way.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.830
It was better for you to start anew with new memories

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.290
rather than to live in pain,

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.520
suffering from your past memories.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.030
It wasn't an easy decision to make.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.840
Decision?

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.080
You had no right to decide for me!

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.830
Those are <i>my</i> memories.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.410
It was <i>my</i> past.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.050
Doctor.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.680
He's Joonsang.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.600
Joonsang Kang.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:24.660
I know it sounds strange,

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.310
and I'm sure you still think he's just someone who looks like him, but...

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.490
It's been ten years.

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:30.290
You've thought about him for ten years.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.570
Isn't that enough?

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.610
How much longer are you going to dwell on him?

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:36.820
Sanghyuk...

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:38.740
Yujin,

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.130
I don't like that you remember Joonsang

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:43.000
every time you see Mr. Minhyung.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.710
No, I don't even like hearing the name "Joonsang".

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.460
Then what should I do?

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.590
I want to forget him too.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.590
I want to forget everything about him.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:02.520
But no matter how hard I try, my eyes still remember him.

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:05.600
My heart still remembers him.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.650
Believe me when I say that he...

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.870
He's not just someone that looks like Joonsang.

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.540
The Joonsang that we all thought was dead...

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.370
was actually alive.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:55.360
The external injuries you sustained from the accident had all healed,

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.010
but the psychological trauma that you suffered

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.240
was greater than we expected.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:04.470
We just couldn't sit and watch you suffer

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.330
from denying all your past memories.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.250
Then why did you plant false memories?

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.500
Couldn't you have just restored the right memories?

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.460
The Joonsang of the past was unhappy.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.430
You probably can't even imagine all the hardships he had to go through

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:22.100
growing up as an illegitimate child with his horrible mother.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:25.930
So Joonsang despised me, his mother.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.940
I actually tried to heal some of your wounds from the past through hypnosis,

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:35.900
but it pained you to even peek into those past wounds.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.120
That's why we decided to gift you with new memories

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.280
to replace your past misfortunes.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.820
You call it a "gift"?

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.460
Because of that gift, I've lived the past ten years of my life

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.620
embracing false memories as my own.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:49.960
I'm not a surgeon,

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.750
but there are times where you have to amputate a limb

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:54.840
in order to save a patient's life.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.220
I still have no regrets about the decision I made back then.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.510
Minhyung!

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.470
Minhyung!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.980
Losing Joonsang was like torture to me.

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:02.440
But you have no idea how much of a relief it was

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.490
when I gained you from it, Minhyung.

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.490
You loved me.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:11.040
I was so happy because of you.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.960
I'm not going to ask for your forgiveness;

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.500
could you just try to understand your mother's feelings?

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:47.870
Coming.

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:53.750
What brings you here at this time of night, without even calling ahead?

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.710
Aren't you happy to see your daughter?

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.380
I'll just go back home then.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.000
Oh you.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.880
Come on in, it's cold out.

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:06.220
You should have told me you were coming.

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.680
I just wanted to come here all of a sudden.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:10.210
Your cast came off.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.810
So you're all better now?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.640
Geez, Mom.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.060
I'm fine; don't you believe me?

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:21.110
Yujin!

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:44.670
I'm going to marry Yujin as soon as possible.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:49.870
As soon as possible?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.180
What do you mean?

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:56.310
I don't want to leave her alone like this.

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:58.780
Not her.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.480
I still can't forgive her.

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.610
Darling.

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:03.660
I'm sorry.

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:06.690
I don't have time to wait for your forgiveness, Mother.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:08.450
What?

00:22:08.860 --> 00:22:09.700
Sanghyuk.

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:10.990
What's wrong with this kid?

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:15.750
Please let it go, just this once.

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:18.960
Just this once.

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.750
I can't do that.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.340
Have I ever asked anything of you like this?

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.380
Please, just this once.

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:32.760
Mother.

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:36.680
Over my dead body.

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:45.110
What's the rush?

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:48.150
This is only going to make it harder for both you and Yujin.

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:49.780
Father.

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.580
I don't want to lose Yujin.

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:07.590
I'll try talking to your mom again.

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:20.500
Why didn't you tell me

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.770
from the beginning?

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:30.360
Joonsang was...

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:36.330
He was my first love.
